{"version":1,"content":"<p>浙江杭州警方今天（22日）通報，有互聯網「獨角獸」之稱的盤石集團因涉嫌合同詐騙被立案偵查，創辦人田寧已被採取刑事強制措施，警方正全力偵辦及追贓。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:24.044459+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":72,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:11:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T23:37:53.774926+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:57:59.263099+00:00","content_hash":"2155cad954c737ea6b6c1fa469e3004529ebb6fbfc470d857165105eafec383e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}